13:35.600 --> 13:36.150
Hupo.

13:36.670 --> 13:37.910
Pergi lihat ke pintu gerbang.

13:37.910 --> 13:38.440
Baik.

13:40.000 --> 13:40.600
Ibu.

13:41.200 --> 13:41.960
